&lt;h2 id="summary">Summary:&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>We created a Hugo partial to dynamically fetch and embed a Gradio app.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>We handle API failures gracefully, displaying a fallback message.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>This approach keeps your Hugo site flexible, with no need for rebuilds when the URL changes.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item></channel></rss>